{"kind":"boltworks-plugin-package","packageVersion":1,"manifest":{"kind":"boltworks-plugin","manifestVersion":1,"id":"scene-rendering","name":"Scene Rendering","version":"1.2.0","description":"Optional lighting workspace for a static model copy. Adjust main and mirror lamps, position, aim, strength and cone angle; show guides and view fullscreen. Keeps editor lighting unchanged. Base colors and named textures are supported; animated rigs and custom shader materials are not transferred. Select parts and preview reversible weathering, loosened pieces and partial collapse. Reset restores the received copy. Fire placement and damage export are not included yet.","runtime":"sandbox-html","entry":"main.html","apiVersion":2,"enabled":false,"dependencies":[],"contributes":{"toolbar":"scenes","modelSnapshot":true,"fullscreen":true}},"files":{"main.html":{"mediaType":"text/html","data":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Scene Rendering</title><style>:root{font:14px/1.5 \"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:#dce7e8;background:#142125;color-scheme:dark}body{margin:20px}h1{font-size:26px}.compact-row,.toggle-grid{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:12px 0}input,button,select{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:#263a40;border:1px solid #54727a;border-radius:5px;padding:7px}input[type=number]{width:80px}button{cursor:pointer}canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:440px;background:#101a20;border-radius:8px}canvas:fullscreen{width:100vw;height:100vh}#status{color:#a6d6c9}.damage-panel{margin:20px 0;padding:18px;border:1px solid #3c575d;border-radius:8px;background:#192c31}.damage-panel h2{margin-top:0;font-size:19px}#damageParts{display:block;width:100%;margin:12px 0;min-height:125px}#partSearch{max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}.condition{display:block;font-weight:600}.condition output{float:right}.condition input{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;padding:0;accent-color:#60d9c1}summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;padding:12px 0}@media(max-width:600px){body{margin:12px}canvas{height:330px}.damage-panel{padding:12px}}</style><h1>Scene Rendering</h1><p>Choose Send current model above to light a separate static copy. Your editor scene and its lighting settings stay unchanged.</p><button id=\"fullscreen\">Fullscreen preview</button><p id=\"status\" role=\"status\">Waiting for a model copy.</p><canvas id=\"preview\"></canvas><section class=\"damage-panel\"><h2>Rundown preview</h2><p>Click a part, or select it in the list. Shift-click adds parts. Dragging still orbits the camera.</p><div class=\"compact-row\"><button id=\"selectAllParts\">Select all</button><button id=\"clearParts\">Clear selection</button><span id=\"selectionCount\">0 selected</span></div><label>Find parts <input id=\"partSearch\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"Roof, beam, window...\"></label><select id=\"damageParts\" multiple size=\"6\" aria-label=\"Parts to damage\"></select><label class=\"condition\">Condition: intact to ruined <output id=\"damageValue\">0%</output><input id=\"damageAmount\" type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\"></label><p>Low strength weathers surfaces. Higher strength loosens, drops or hides some whole parts. This is a reversible preview, not a fracture simulation.</p><div class=\"compact-row\"><button id=\"resetSelected\">Restore selected</button><button id=\"resetDamage\">Reset all damage</button></div><p id=\"damageSummary\" role=\"status\">Original BWS model unchanged.</p></section><details><summary>Lighting controls</summary>        <div id=\"sceneRenderingTools\">\n          <strong>Scene Rendering</strong>\n          <div class=\"toggle-grid\">\n            <label class=\"toggle-chip\"><input id=\"showLightGuidesInput\" type=\"checkbox\" /> <span>Show Light Guides</span></label>\n            <label class=\"toggle-chip\"><input id=\"enablePrimaryLightInput\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> <span>Main Lamp</span></label>\n            <label class=\"toggle-chip\"><input id=\"enableMirrorLightInput\" type=\"checkbox\" checked /> <span>Mirror Lamp</span></label>\n          </div>\n        <div class=\"compact-row\">\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Lamp X <input id=\"lightPosXInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"-6\" /></label>\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Y <input id=\"lightPosYInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"5\" /></label>\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Z <input id=\"lightPosZInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"6\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"compact-row\">\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Aim X <input id=\"lightTargetXInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"0\" /></label>\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Y <input id=\"lightTargetYInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"1.5\" /></label>\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Z <input id=\"lightTargetZInput\" type=\"number\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"0\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"compact-row\">\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Lamp Strength <input id=\"lightIntensityInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"40\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"10\" /></label>\n          <label style=\"flex:1\">Cone Deg <input id=\"lightAngleInput\" type=\"number\" min=\"5\" max=\"80\" step=\"1\" value=\"24\" /></label>\n        </div>\n        </div>\n</details><p>Damage is temporary in this plugin window. Reset or resend the model to restore it. Fire placement and exporting damaged scenes are not included yet.</p><script>(()=>{var Qn={LEFT:0,MIDDLE:1,RIGHT:2,ROTATE:0,DOLLY:1,PAN:2},ti={ROTATE:0,PAN:1,DOLLY_PAN:2,DOLLY_ROTATE:3},gc=0,ao=1,_c=2;var Bl=1,Va=2,ln=3,Tn=0,Ee=1,cn=2,wn=0,Mi=1,oo=2,lo=3,co=4,xc=5,Wn=100,vc=101,yc=102,Mc=103,Sc=104,bc=200,Ec=201,wc=202,Ac=203,$r=204,jr=205,Tc=206,Rc=207,Cc=208,Pc=209,Ic=210,Lc=211,Uc=212,Dc=213,Nc=214,Oc=0,Fc=1,Bc=2,Ps=3,zc=4,kc=5,Vc=6,Hc=7,zl=0,Gc=1,Wc=2,An=0,Xc=1,Yc=2,qc=3,Ha=4,Zc=5,Jc=6,Kc=7;var kl=300,wi=301,Ai=302,Qr=303